  "releaseNotes": "0.7.1: Usage analyzers and code fixes\n- Supply JEV100 and JEV101 usage diagnostics and code fixes through the JRK.JevRunner.Analyzers package dependency, without embedding duplicate assemblies.\n- Add Escape.Interpolated(FormattableString) to return a string with automatic quoting for state references and paths, retaining ordinary argument formatting. Its code fix simplifies qualification where safe and avoids shadowed local names.\n- Usage diagnostics recognize marker interfaces inherited through generic class constraints and chained type parameters.",
